                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "⭐⭐⭐⭐☆ (4/5)\n\nThe food was indeed delicious, but the prices were high, and the hygiene needs improvement. The fried chicken (5 pieces for 75 yuan) wasn\u0027t great value. The toast basket was a bit dirty, and the forks weren\u0027t clean, which was a little worrying. However, the overall environment was relatively clean. The teppanyaki noodles had a lot of sauce, making them a bit watery. It\u0027s worth mentioning that the staff were very friendly and helpful. If they could improve the hygiene, it would definitely be worth a visit again!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "⭐⭐⭐⭐☆ (4/5)\n\n食物確實好吃，但價格偏高，且衛生狀況需要改善。鹽酥雞 5 塊 75 元，CP 值不高。吐司的籃子有點髒，叉子也沒洗乾淨，這點讓人不太放心。不過整體環境還算乾淨，鐵板麵的醬汁較多，口感偏湯湯水水。值得一提的是，店員態度非常好，服務親切，如果能改善衛生問題，會更值得再訪！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
